## 📖 CSS Animation

CSS animations allow elements to change from one style to another over a period of time.

Example:

```css
.loader {
    animation: loading 1s infinite;
}

@keyframes loading {
    from {
        transform: rotate(0deg);
    }

    to {
        transform: rotate(360deg);
    }
}
```

